-- Run on the client. In Studio: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts > LocalScript.
-- BOOST applies the selected options; RESET restores our changes.
-- No map deletion, texture removal, physics edits, or FPS-cap changes.
-- Distant effects and saved graphics quality are optional and OFF by default.

